Mantella NPCs who live through OStim scenes with you: scenes that flow on their own, and partners who react, talk and remember.

[center][size=5][font=Trebuchet MS][b][color=#93c47d]FEATURES[/color][/b][/font][/size][/center][table][tr][th]Feature[/th][th]What it does[/th][/tr][tr][td]Scene flows[/td][td]Builds each scene live from your own animation packs[/td][/tr][tr][td]Finish scenes[/td][td]Played when the man is close; borrowed from another pack if needed[/td][/tr][tr][td]Not satisfied?[/td][td]A new round starts in the same pack after her climax[/td][/tr][tr][td]Your control[/td][td]Pick a scene yourself and the flow steps back[/td][/tr][tr][td]Favourite positions[/td][td]Rated from her personality, learned from your scenes[/td][/tr][tr][td]Position requests[/td][td]Ask her in conversation; she switches if it fits[/td][/tr][tr][td]Group scenes[/td][td]Scene talk names everyone; flows stay two-person[/td][/tr][/table][center][size=5][font=Trebuchet MS][b][color=#93c47d]WHAT MANTELLA HEARS[/color][/b][/font][/size][/center][table][tr][th]Moment[/th][th]Example line[/th][/tr][tr][td]Scene starts or moves on[/td][td]Mjoll and the player have started: a blowjob.[/td][/tr][tr][td]Excitement 30 / 50 / 75[/td][td]Mjoll is really into it now; she reacts out loud.[/td][/tr][tr][td]Pace change[/td][td]The pace picks up; it is now steady.[/td][/tr][tr][td]Climax[/td][td]Mjoll just climaxed.  (+ a remark from someone watching)[/td][/tr][tr][td]Scene ends[/td][td]One summary: where, how long, what you did, climaxes.[/td][/tr][/table]
