[center][size=5][font=Trebuchet MS][b][color=#93c47d]REQUIREMENTS[/color][/b][/font][/size][/center][list]
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/196849]Mantella Living World - Integration Hub[/url][/*][*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/98631]Mantella[/url] 0.14[/*][*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/98163]OStim Standalone[/url] and at least one animation pack[/*][*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/196851]Mantella Living World - Arousal[/url] (recommended)[/*][/list][center][size=5][font=Trebuchet MS][b][color=#93c47d]BEFORE YOU START[/color][/b][/font][/size][/center][list=1]
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/98631]Mantella[/url] 0.14: install it and check that a normal conversation works.[/*][*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/196214]Mantella - Direct AI Connect[/url]: install it below Mantella in MO2 and run its Setup Backend.cmd once (needs Python 3.11). Without it the stock Mantella.exe runs and Living World does nothing.[/*][*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/196849]Mantella Living World - Integration Hub[/url], then the modules you want.[/*][*]API key: your LLM service's key stays in GPT_SECRET_KEY.txt in the Mantella mod folder (in MO2, right-click Mantella, Open in Explorer). A key for another service goes in the file named on the Direct AI Connect page, next to it.[/*][*]Open Mantella's settings page (http://localhost:4999/ui in your browser, only while Mantella is running), go to the Actions tab and turn on Advanced Actions. Many Living World actions (bribe, persuade, marriage steps, positions, map marks and others) only work with it, and it needs a model that supports tool calling.[/*][*]Nothing happens? Living World Main Status in Mantella's settings page lists what is missing.[/*][/list][center][size=5][font=Trebuchet MS][b][color=#93c47d]INSTALLATION[/color][/b][/font][/size][/center][list=1]
[*]Install the hub, then this module. In MO2's left pane, place this mod below Actions For Mantella - Expanded Sex Actions (from [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/174770]Mantella - Community Resources[/url]): it replaces five of that mod's action files, and placed above it the ungated versions win.[/*][*]Close the game and run Build Flows (in the mod's tools folder; needs Python and Mod Organizer 2).[/*][*]Enable the generated Flows mod.[/*][*]Run Build Flows again whenever you add or remove animation packs.[/*][/list][center][size=5][font=Trebuchet MS][b][color=#93c47d]NOTES[/color][/b][/font][/size][/center][list]
[*]Settings: OStim's MCM, page "Living World".[/*][*]Flows stay two-person; group scenes still get scene talk.[/*][/list][center][size=5][font=Trebuchet MS][b][color=#93c47d]SOURCE AND LICENSE[/color][/b][/font][/size][/center][url=https://github.com/Abhisek571/Mantella-Living-World-OStim-Expansion]GitHub[/url], GNU AGPL-3.0 (Mantella is AGPL-3.0). Unofficial, not endorsed by the authors of the mods it works with.

